vertices(LeafTree) -- list the vertices of a tree
*************************************************

  * Function: *note vertices: (Polyhedra)vertices,
  * Usage: 
        vertices T
  * Inputs:
      * T, an instance of the type *note LeafTree: LeafTree,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, the vertices of T

Description
===========

This function lists all vertices of a tree.  Each vertex is specified by the
partition of the set of leaves formed by removing the vertex.  Each partition
is given as a list of sets.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : T = leafTree(4,{{0,1}});                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : vertices T                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {set {set {3}, set {2}, set {0, 1}}, set {set {0, 1, 2}}, set {set {0,  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     1, 3}}, set {set {1}, set {2, 3}, set {0}}, set {set {0, 2, 3}}, set    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     {set {1, 2, 3}}}                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : #(vertices T)                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 6                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

The leaves of T in the output of vertices have a different representation from
the one in the output of *note leaves(LeafTree): leaves_lpLeafTree_rp,.

